---
title: Upstash
id: upstash-adapter
order: 3
description: "Back TanStack AI persistence, resumable streams, locks, and memory with Upstash Redis, so they hold across serverless instances, reloads, and devices."
keywords:
  - tanstack ai
  - upstash
  - redis
  - persistence
  - resumable streams
  - locks
  - memory
  - serverless
  - community adapter
---
